# Welcome to EasyLang

Show Welcome to my programming language!

Make age = 18

If age is greater than 15
    Show You are eligible
Else
    Show You are not eligible
End

Make first = 10
Make second = 5

Add first and second into total
Show Addition result:
Show total

Subtract second from first into difference
Show Subtraction result:
Show difference

Multiply first and second into product
Show Multiplication result:
Show product

Divide first and second into quotient
Show Division result:
Show quotient

Repeat 3 times
    Show EasyLang is simple!
End

Make number = 1

While number is less than 4
    Show number
    Add number and 1 into number
End

Create function introduce with name and age
    Show Hello, name!
    Show Age: age
End

Call introduce with Alex and 18
Call introduce with Priya and 20

Ask What is your name? and store it as username
Show Welcome to EasyLang, username!

Show Program completed successfully!